# Seven essays after the midterm

Six free investigations and one essay from the 300-attempt idea search. Open a title for its argument, what changed after criticism, and all five files in its completed writing cycle. These seven extend the collection beyond the original 100-essay midterm corpus.

Dates below mark accepted release packages in America/Los_Angeles. The order follows essay IDs.

